# aggr_update on its own, with area_update, at the entrance to Mud School (3700) and in the temple (3001).
# - a fido (0) and a monster (1), both aggressive and wimpy, leave Decimus (10) and Delver (2) alone while they're
#   awake, and Smokegod (60) always; once Delver sleeps, he's attacked
# - a goblin (6, aggressive) in the temple, which is safe, leaves Purser (10) alone
# - a goblin at the entrance attacks Decimus, Delver awake again; once fighting it doesn't start again
# - a goblin in a calmed room leaves everyone alone
@updates area,aggr
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
set skill smokegod all 100
set char smokegod mana 30000
restore smokegod
goto 3700
@connect dec
Decimus
psswrd
@return
@return
@connect delver
Delver
psswrd
@return
@return
@connect purse
Purser
psswrd
@return
@return
@as god
transfer decimus 3700
transfer delver 3700
@mob 3062 3700
@pulse 40
@mob 3705 3700
@pulse 40
@as delver
sleep
@as god
@pulse 40
peace
@mob 3501 3001
@pulse 40
@as delver
wake
@as god
@mob 3501 3700
@pulse 40
peace
purge
@mob 3501 3700
cast calm
@pulse 40
@state
